---
// Official client brand lockup: the yin-yang / acupuncture-needle symbol
// extracted from Min's supplied artwork, plus the practice name typeset in
// the site fonts using the artwork's own colours (green #1B9B55, dark
// #264B4C, subtitle #678182). The tagline is hidden by CSS below 1200px so
// the header stays compact.
---
<span class="brand-lockup">
  <img
    src="/assets/brand/tcm-official-symbol.webp"
    alt=""
    width="362"
    height="480"
    class="brand-lockup-symbol"
    loading="eager"
    decoding="async"
  />
  <span class="brand-lockup-text">
    <span class="brand-lockup-name"
      ><span class="brand-lockup-green">TCM&nbsp;Praxis</span> Weissenberger-Lu</span
    >
    <span class="brand-lockup-sub">Traditionelle Chinesische Medizin</span>
  </span>
</span>
